XR:
S=Start(5)
For I=0 To 99 : Poke S+I,(I*7+3) mod 256 : Next I
Return
XS:
S=Start(5)
Print #1," ";Hex$(Bank Checksum(5),8);" ";Peek(S);" ";Peek(S+1);" ";Peek(S+2);" ";Peek(S+3);" ";Peek(S+9);" ";Peek(S+10);" ";Peek(S+49);" ";Peek(S+50);" ";Peek(S+51);" ";Peek(S+98);" ";Peek(S+99)
Gosub XR
Return
FIN:
